WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.820
One brand led mentions.

2
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.940
The first-place choices split.

3
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.280
In Recoscope’s October 30
skincare snapshot,

4
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.640
11 of 12 captured answers
were usable.

5
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.080
CeraVe appeared in 8 of 11.

6
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.320
La Roche-Posay appeared in 7.

7
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.360
But the comparative answers
split 2–2.

8
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:22.140
ChatGPT and Gemini ranked
La Roche-Posay first.

9
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.840
Claude and Perplexity
ranked CeraVe first.

10
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.260
For brand teams, track both:

11
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.840
mention frequency
measures visibility.

12
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.200
Comparative rank describes
an individual captured answer.

13
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.580
An incomplete Gemini discovery
answer was excluded.

14
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.960
Two valid answers named no brands
and still count.

15
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.960
These findings don’t establish
product quality, clinical effectiveness,

16
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.740
safety or market share.

17
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.500
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
